      <h1><em>Clay-Bound Gold</em>: The Processing Challenge</h1>
      <p>Clay-bound gold defeats many mining operations, but with the right techniques and equipment, these difficult deposits can be highly profitable. Learn proven methods to liberate gold from sticky clay.</p>
